  triage:description "docs/adr/ADR-061-governed-interface-schema-versioning.md:100-109 now has two contradictory AZ.3 D5 entries: the correct 2026-09-10 (1.4.0->1.5.0) entry sits directly above an uncorrected stale 2026-09-09 entry claiming 1.3.0->1.4.0. Introduced by this round's own SCHEMA-COLLISION fix, which added the new entry without removing the old one. docs/plans/phase-az/phase-az-plan.md:174 also still states the stale bump. Fix: delete the stale ADR-061 entry and correct the plan doc. Source: QA-2 on PR #1382 (https://github.com/randlee/atm-core/pull/1382)." ;
